---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import bgpLogo from '../assets/bgp-logo.png';
import penesonLogo from '../assets/peneson-logo.png';
---

<Layout title="About OceanHub | Offshore Collaboration Platform" description="OceanHub connects offshore operators and specialist partners around shared technical questions and decision-ready marine evidence.">
  <section class="relative py-24 md:py-32 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 text-center relative z-10">
      <div class="hud-badge mb-6 reveal"><i class="fa-solid fa-compass" aria-hidden="true"></i> PLATFORM MISSION</div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-8 font-display reveal" style="transition-delay: 80ms;">
        Connect offshore capability<br />
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-sky-300 to-blue-500">around the decision.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-2xl text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-light reveal" style="transition-delay: 140ms;">
        OceanHub is a shared platform for framing offshore problems, connecting complementary expertise and organising evidence that can be used across project decisions.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 relative">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="glass-card p-8 md:p-14 reveal">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10">
          <div class="lg:col-span-4">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Why OceanHub</div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white font-display">Offshore evidence crosses organisational boundaries.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-6 text-base md:text-lg text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-light">
            <p>Offshore wind, carbon storage, marine infrastructure and environmental monitoring depend on many of the same observations: bathymetry, shallow geology, soil conditions, oceanographic context and repeatable spatial evidence.</p>
            <p>Those observations are often acquired by different contractors, interpreted by different disciplines and delivered for separate project stages. OceanHub creates a collaboration layer so the problem, evidence need and intended decision remain visible across those handoffs.</p>
            <p>It does not replace operators, engineering consultants or specialist technology companies. It helps assemble the right combination of those capabilities around a clearly defined offshore question.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 reveal">
        <div class="hud-badge mb-4"><i class="fa-solid fa-diagram-project" aria-hidden="true"></i> OPERATING PRINCIPLES</div>
        <h2 class="heading-section">A simple collaboration model</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <article class="glass-card p-8 reveal">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-3">01 / FRAME</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4 font-display">Start with the decision</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Clarify what must be decided, what is already known, which uncertainty matters and what evidence would change the choice.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="glass-card p-8 reveal" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-3">02 / CONNECT</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4 font-display">Assemble complementary capability</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Connect marine geophysics, geotechnics, environmental observation, monitoring and engineering interpretation as the problem requires.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="glass-card p-8 reveal" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-3">03 / DELIVER</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4 font-display">Design outputs for use</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Organise provenance, uncertainty, interpretation and decision interfaces so evidence can be reviewed and reused across the project lifecycle.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 border-y border-cyan-500/10 bg-[#040810]/70">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 reveal">
          <div class="hud-badge mb-4"><i class="fa-solid fa-comments" aria-hidden="true"></i> INDUSTRY DIALOGUE</div>
          <h2 class="heading-section mb-6">Ocean Talks</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 font-light">OceanHub also supports technical dialogue across geophysics, offshore development, marine monitoring and policy. Ocean Talks provides a public setting for testing ideas and connecting organisations that do not usually work in the same room.</p>
          <a href="https://rio25.sbgf.org.br/Pages/oceanHub.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 hover:bg-cyan-500/20 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all">View SBGf Rio 25 programme <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-6 reveal" style="transition-delay: 120ms;">
          <div class="glass-card p-8 md:p-10">
            <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-white font-display font-bold leading-relaxed mb-6">Useful dialogue should connect a technical method to the project decision, delivery constraint or governance question it is meant to address.</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-300">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-2 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 shrink-0"></span>Share practical offshore problems rather than generic technology claims.</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-2 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 shrink-0"></span>Make uncertainty, evidence limits and implementation conditions explicit.</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-2 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 shrink-0"></span>Create follow-up paths for collaboration, field trials and shared learning.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <div class="hud-badge mb-4 reveal"><i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired" aria-hidden="true"></i> FOUNDING NETWORK</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-6 font-display reveal">Complementary capability, open architecture</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14 text-base font-light reveal">The initial network brings together marine geophysical and offshore geotechnical delivery. OceanHub remains open to additional operators, technology providers, researchers and project partners.</p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto reveal">
        <div class="glass-card p-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
          <Image src={bgpLogo} alt="BGP Offshore" width={200} class="brightness-0 invert opacity-80 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity mb-4 w-44" />
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Marine Geophysics</span>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-card p-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
          <Image src={penesonLogo} alt="Guangzhou Peneson" width={200} class="brightness-0 invert opacity-80 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity mb-4 w-44" />
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Marine Geotechnics</span>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-card p-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center border-dashed border-cyan-500/30">
          <div class="text-white font-bold mb-3 font-display">Join the network</div>
          <a href="mailto:info@oceanhub.com" class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 uppercase tracking-wider">Propose a collaboration →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
